// Frostline: four against four across a land bridge between two oceans, the
// Precursors' climate wall down the middle of it all. West of the wall,
// red-rock desert under a clear, dry sky; east of it, Alaska: cloud piled
// against the wall, snow in the air. The line is the bake's
// (`mc_map::landmark::FROSTLINE_WALL`; `tests/frostline.rs` holds the two
// together), and so is the lift that lays the canyon's beds on this map's
// lower country. Skirmish set-up can override the weather (over both sides)
// and the time of day.
(
    biome: Desert,
    style: Teams,
    climate: Desert,
    weather: Clear,
    tweaks: (rain: 0.0, wind: 9),
    time: Afternoon,
    strata_lift: 50,
    divide: (
        line: [(6592, 0), (6592, 3400), (8192, 5000), (8192, 11384), (9792, 12984), (9792, 16384)],
        climate: Temperate,
        weather: Cloudy,
        tweaks: (rain: 0.7),
    ),
)
